WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.075 --> 00:00:16.788
"We need a spell," Cat said.

2
00:00:16.789 --> 00:00:20.556
"Where's your wand?"

3
00:00:20.557 --> 00:00:25.891
Tom's wand was still stuck in the mud.

4
00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:30.866
Cat pulled and tugged.

5
00:00:30.867 --> 00:00:34.405
But the wand stayed stuck.

6
00:00:34.406 --> 00:00:40.830
Then Tom and Cat pulled together.

7
00:00:40.831 --> 00:00:48.788
Pop! Out came the wand!

8
00:00:48.789 --> 00:00:52.949
"Time for a spell!" Tom said.

9
00:00:52.950 --> 00:00:56.478
He waved his wand.

10
00:00:56.479 --> 00:01:02.845
Poof! A pink bunny appeared.

11
00:01:02.846 --> 00:01:06.794
Poof! A blueberry bush appeared.

12
00:01:06.795 --> 00:01:17.813
Tom waved his wand again and again . . . And again.

13
00:01:17.814 --> 00:01:21.734
Tom looked at Cat.

14
00:01:21.735 --> 00:01:25.708
"I'm a terrible wizard," he said.

15
00:01:25.709 --> 00:01:33.862
"You have a kind heart," Cat said.

16
00:01:33.863 --> 00:01:37.151
Tom closed his eyes.

17
00:01:37.152 --> 00:01:44.036
One more time he thought of Princess Mary.

18
00:01:44.037 --> 00:01:47.784
One more time he lifted his wand.

19
00:01:47.785 --> 00:01:50.304
"Pinkberry bush so rare . . .

20
00:01:50.305 --> 00:01:53.133
Appear right there!"

21
00:01:53.134 --> 00:01:56.996
Poof! Smoke filled the clearing.

22
00:01:56.997 --> 00:02:01.592
Tom coughed—and then he saw it.

23
00:02:01.593 --> 00:02:10.455
"A pinkberry bush!" Cat cried.

24
00:02:10.456 --> 00:02:14.367
Tom filled his sack with juicy pinkberries.

25
00:02:14.368 --> 00:02:17.881
"Take some branches too," Cat said.

26
00:02:17.882 --> 00:02:24.956
"I'll explain later!"

27
00:02:24.957 --> 00:02:44.549
Cat led the way out of the Dark Forest.

28
00:02:44.550 --> 00:03:00.601
Soon Tom was back at the palace.

29
00:03:00.602 --> 00:03:04.608
"Pinkberries!" the royal doctor cried.

30
00:03:04.609 --> 00:03:21.126
"I'll make the juice!" Cook cried.

31
00:03:21.127 --> 00:03:25.032
The royal gardener took the branches from Tom.

32
00:03:25.033 --> 00:03:29.282
"I'll plant them in the Royal Garden," he said.

33
00:03:29.283 --> 00:03:31.743
Dirk was furious.

34
00:03:31.744 --> 00:03:44.274
But everyone else was very, very happy.
